<div id="class-info">
  <div id="ninja-icon"></div>
  <h2>Ninja</h2>
  <p>Role: Melee attacks, Burst DPS. Ninjas evade enemy blows while building up brutal combo attacks.</p>
</div>
<% if @level <= 29 %>
  <div id="skills">
    <div class="skill">
      <span class="icon decoy-jutsu"></span>
      <p>Decoy Jutsu</p>
      <p>Drop a decoy target while you teleport behind your target to deliver a quick attack.</p>
    </div>
     <div class="skill">
      <span class="icon one-thousand-cuts"></span>
      <p>One Thousand Cuts</p>
      <p>Charge straight forward to deliver a staggering series of blows, while becoming temporarily immune to damage.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="skill">
      <span class="icon jagged-path"></span>
      <p>Jagged Path</p>
      <p>Dash forward in a zig-zag pattern and strike a stunning blow to the first target you encounter.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="skill">
      <span class="icon circle-of-steel"></span>
      <p>Circle of Steel</p>
      <p>Throw your shuriken at nearby enemies to suspend them in the air while dealing damage (particularly on the final hit).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
<% else %>
  <div id="crystals">
    <div class="pve">
      <h3>PvE Crystals</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="red-crystal">Bitter, Savage, Focused, Forceful</li>
        <li class="blue-crystal">Hardy</li>
        <li class="green-crystal">Carving, Powerful</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="pvp">
      <h3>PvP Crystals</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="red-crystal">Savage, Forceful, Salivating, Cruel</li>
        <li class="blue-crystal">Relentless, Warding</li>
        <li class="green-crystal">Griefing</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>